  "_comment": "Drift guard between the two validators (apps/api: kernel config and identity settings; apps/web: src/lib/env.server.ts). Test fixture only, read by tests/unit/test_config_cases.py and src/lib/env-cases.test.ts; nothing reads it at runtime. Each case is an environment delta over `base` (null unsets a variable) and the variables both apps must name in their problems (none: both must accept it). A case that both accept may also list `authorizedParties`: the origins both apps must end up trusting for a session token's azp claim, in order. `origins` maps an address to the origin both apps must read it as (null: neither takes it as an origin), for APP_BASE_URL and CLERK_AUTHORIZED_PARTIES; the API's answers are the reference. Values are synthetic.",
